---
title: Contact Us
description: Get in touch with ClarifyPost for suggestions, corrections, or business inquiries.
permalink: /contact/index.html
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<div class="container" style="padding: var(--space-xl) 0; max-width: 800px; min-height: 60vh;">
  <article class="article-body">
    <header class="article-header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
      <h1 class="article-title">Contact Us</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-family: var(--font-ui);">We would love to hear from you.</p>
    </header>

    <p>Whether you have a question about one of our guides, a suggestion for a new article, or a business inquiry, my inbox is always open.</p>

    <div style="background: var(--color-surface-raised); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: var(--space-lg); border-radius: var(--radius-md); text-align: center; margin: var(--space-xl) 0;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-family: var(--font-display);">Email Me Directly</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md); font-family: var(--font-ui);">For all inquiries, please reach out via email:</p>
      <a href="mailto:connect@dippan.com.np" style="display: inline-block; background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-surface); padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-ui);">connect@dippan.com.np</a>
    </div>

  </article>
</div>
{% endblock %}